ption">{{item.mistakeDescription}}</p><p v-if="item.correction" class="preview-correction">✓ {{item.correction}}</p></div></div></div><div class="preview-actions"><button>立即录制训练视频</button><button class="secondary">从相册选择视频</button></div></div></section></aside>
